      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Detached two bedroom thatched cottage.\r\nIn good condition throughout. \r\nExceptional one-off property with unique and traditional features.\r\nExtending to approximately 169 sq. m (1,819 sq. ft).\r\nLocated approximately 7km from Duleek town.\r\nSite area extending to approximately 0.11 hectare (0.27 acre).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property comprises a well laid out and spacious detached two bedroom thatched cottage. The property is presented in good condition throughout and benefits from enclosed mature garden in a private countryside setting. The accommodation comprises an entrance hall, open plan kitchen/dining area, living room with solid fuel stove, two double bedrooms (master en-suite), family bathroom & storage/hot press. Local amenities can be accessed in nearby Duleek and include a range of shops, schools, bars, restaurants & sports clubs.\r\n\r\nVacant Possession"
      },
